<!--
  A message bubble whose contents are sorted, colour-coded rows.

  Says both halves of what the app is: these are SMS, and they have been put
  in order. The previous icon was a prism, which was a fair metaphor for
  separation but told nobody it had anything to do with messages.

  The three swatches use the app's real category colours (money, bills,
  codes), so the icon shows the actual product rather than decoration.

  Content stays within x,y in [15,93] of the 108 viewport, inside the
  adaptive-icon keyline.
-->
